<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Rapid Metabolism</ansi> mutation

Your body burns through reserves at an alarming rate, recovering
stamina quickly but sacrificing durability. You are a sprinter, not
a marathon runner.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Uncommon

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Moderately faster stamina recovery — your accelerated metabolism
  replenishes endurance with impressive speed

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Slightly reduced maximum health — your body burns through itself
  as readily as it recovers

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
